    "html": "<p>Hi {{first_name}},</p>\n<p>The paperback is $67, shipped free in the US. That\u2019s more than most books, so here\u2019s what\u2019s included.</p>\n<p>The paperback, plus the digital edition so you can start today. The 21-Day Power Reset Journal, with a page for every day. Three bonuses: The Tactic Spotter (common pressure moves and one calm reply for each), The Conversation Planner (prepare one hard conversation, start to finish) and The Power Map and Decision Cards (the book\u2019s eight tools, one card each). And 60 days of the companion app.</p>\n<p>The price is also a small commitment, on purpose. A cheap book is easy to buy and never open. This one is meant to be used.</p>\n<p>And there\u2019s a plain 30-day money-back guarantee. If it isn\u2019t useful, email me and you\u2019ll get a refund.</p>\n<p>If you\u2019re not ready, that\u2019s fine too. You\u2019ll keep getting these notes.</p>\n<p><a href=\"{{book_link}}\">Get the full book</a></p>\n<p>Nate</p>",
    "text": "Hi {{first_name}},\n\nThe paperback is $67, shipped free in the US. That's more than most books, so here's what's included.\n\nThe paperback, plus the digital edition so you can start today. The 21-Day Power Reset Journal, with a page for every day. Three bonuses: The Tactic Spotter (common pressure moves and one calm reply for each), The Conversation Planner (prepare one hard conversation, start to finish) and The Power Map and Decision Cards (the book's eight tools, one card each). And 60 days of the companion app.\n\nThe price is also a small commitment, on purpose. A cheap book is easy to buy and never open. This one is meant to be used.\n\nAnd there's a plain 30-day money-back guarantee. If it isn't useful, email me and you'll get a refund.\n\nIf you're not ready, that's fine too. You'll keep getting these notes.\n\nGet the full book: {{book_link}}\n\nNate"
